{
  "category": "Star Shape Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Because of its unusual, star-like silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "If the impact site of a meteorite is found, this POKéMON is certain to be within the immediate area.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance until daybreak, when they quench their thirst with the morning dew.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its silhouette is like a star. It is believed to arrive riding on shooting stars.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.",
      "version": "heartgold"
