    {
      "text": "It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these Pokémon quench their thirst with the morning dew.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these Pokémon quench their thirst with the morning dew.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "On late nights illuminated by shooting stars, it gazes intently skyward, as if thinking of its home.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of its silhouette, it’s believed to be a star reborn. For some reason, it loves Minior.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "On nights with many shooting stars, they gather in packs and dance in circles. If you should see them, something good will happen!",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Said to have ridden here on a shooting star, Cleffa seem to appear in places where meteorites have struck in the past.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "In silhouette, they resemble twinkling starlight. When shooting stars rain from the night sky, Cleffa gather in numbers and dance as though they are indeed incarnations of the stars.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
